hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"735","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Bachcha us ka hai jis ke bistar par woh paida hua.'"
"736","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Mamu waris hai.'"
"737","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Maal ko muqarrar hisson walon mein Kitabullah ke mutabiq taqseem karo. Aur jo bache, to woh us mard ke liye hai jo maiyyat se sab se qareeb ho.'"
"738","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jameela bint Sa'd bin Rabi' (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Mere walid aur mere chacha Jang Uhud mein shaheed hue. Mujhe un ki meeras mein se kuch nahin mila; haleefon ne use le liya."
"739","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Muqarrar hisse un ko do jo un ke haqdar hain. Phir jo muqarrar hisson walon ke baad bache, to woh sab se qareebi mard rishtedar (maiyyat ke) ke liye hai.'"
"740","[AI-translation] Wuhaib ne isi sanad se isi ki manind riwayat ki. Ishaq (Rahimahullah) ne kaha: Yani mard ki taraf se, kyunke asabah un mein se nahin hoga."
